WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.977
- Hey everyone, so today in the office

00:00:01.977 --> 00:00:03.799
I thought why not shake things up

00:00:03.799 --> 00:00:06.375
with an interesting game
of would you rather.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:07.652
I'm gonna be asking some coworkers

00:00:07.652 --> 00:00:10.137
some rather unusual would
you rather questions.

00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:12.169
So, let's see what they have to say.

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:15.292
(peppy music)

00:00:15.292 --> 00:00:16.812
Would you rather

00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:20.875
have your girlfriend switch
bodies with your dad for a year

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:24.717
or would you rather switch
genders for two years?

00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:26.994
- I'd rather switch genders for two years.

00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:27.596
- Yeah?

00:00:27.596 --> 00:00:32.033
- Yeah, I don't need my
girlfriend in my dad's body.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.172
- You'll just be a beautiful woman?

00:00:34.172 --> 00:00:36.044
- Yes, thank you for your confidence.

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:38.796
- Would you rather be
pregnant for two years

00:00:38.796 --> 00:00:42.142
or have your period for two years?

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.895
- I would rather be
pregnant for two years.

00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:47.621
Because I could get away with
eating whatever I wanted.

00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:50.281
Who wants their period
for two years, my god.

00:00:50.281 --> 00:00:53.264
- I dunno, maybe Tampax will
sponsor you or something.

00:00:53.264 --> 00:00:55.180
- Think of all the sex you couldn't have.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.442
- Would you rather watch
your parents have sex

00:00:58.442 --> 00:01:00.682
every day for the rest of your life

00:01:00.682 --> 00:01:02.981
or join them once?

00:01:02.981 --> 00:01:04.165
(laughs)

00:01:04.165 --> 00:01:05.465
- I would get used to it.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.416
There are so many
questions that go into it.

00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:08.843
How long are they going to take?

00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:10.202
What would I have to do?

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:12.222
I really value my time,

00:01:12.222 --> 00:01:13.719
and so even though it would be horrible

00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:15.601
I would probably just join them once

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:18.123
so that way I would never
have to do it again.

00:01:18.123 --> 00:01:19.477
- You're a brave soul.

00:01:19.477 --> 00:01:22.982
Would you rather fart
every time you told a lie,

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.199
and very loudly, or sneeze
in your crush's face

00:01:26.199 --> 00:01:28.265
every time they entered a room?

00:01:28.265 --> 00:01:29.217
- These are awful.

00:01:29.217 --> 00:01:30.378
I like people,

00:01:30.378 --> 00:01:32.202
so I wouldn't want to
sneeze in my crush's face

00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:32.980
all the time.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.921
It would just encourage
me, I guess, not to lie.

00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:36.521
So, I think I'd go with that one.

00:01:36.521 --> 00:01:39.841
- Would you rather have your
ex's name tattooed on your body

00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:43.696
or refer to your partner
only by pet names,

00:01:43.696 --> 00:01:46.773
to them, to everyone forever?

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.234
- The tattoo thing is like,
can you get it covered up

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:51.783
into like a sick dolphin
or something, or no?

00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:52.421
- No.

00:01:52.421 --> 00:01:55.690
- Then I'm gonna call the person I love

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.256
by the pet names.

00:01:58.256 --> 00:02:00.776
I had a boyfriend who I used to call poop.

00:02:00.776 --> 00:02:02.911
- That's really romantic.

00:02:02.911 --> 00:02:03.690
- I think it's cute!

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.175
- I think, yeah.

00:02:05.175 --> 00:02:06.475
- We don't care what you think.

00:02:06.475 --> 00:02:07.694
- So those were their answers.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:10.132
Which one of these things
would you rather do?

00:02:10.132 --> 00:02:11.896
Leave a comment below with your answers

00:02:11.896 --> 00:02:13.533
and I'll see you real soon.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.885
- [Black Haired Man] Would
you rather have teeth

00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:16.299
for pubic hair or pubic hair for teeth?

00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:18.070
- Why did you think of this?

